From: AI Browser Control <ai-control@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Add isolated custom HTML to AI control overlays

Allow Overlay.show and Overlay.update callers to provide an optional HTML
document while preserving the existing structured status panel by default.
Custom documents render inside a sandboxed child frame with scripts, network
access, navigation, downloads, popups, cookies and persistent storage disabled.

